                "Aerosil flame burner B-5 at Aerosil-Voe AV-3 already holds free oxygen at 8.2 "
                "percent under a 12.0 percent trip, with flame 1680 C under 1750. Zirconia-first "
                "accepts the 4.8 t/h SiCl4; flame-first would have parked a legal hydrolysis on a "
